    "detailed_description": "House of Specters is a party platformer that progressively gets harder with each level of the house you complete. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nTake control of one of the many colored Specters that run wild throughout the house.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay solo, or grab up to 7 friends to play with as you make your way through 9 very challenging levels meant to test your friendship...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will encounter:<br />\r\n- Lots of jumping<br />\r\n- Moving platforms<br />\r\n- Special platforms<br />\r\n- Moving saws<br />\r\n- Fans blowing you around<br />\r\n- Checkpoints (for those long levels)<br />\r\n- And so much more!",
